  RootNode:
    dialogues:
    - "Food Bank Headquarters \u2013 Afternoon0000l"
    - "p:Hey, you! What\u2019s been going on? I heard part of the food supply was
      missing last night.0312r"
    - p:You better not have done anything behind my back.0312r
    - "p:Nevermind. I\u2019ll just go ask the workers. They\u2019ll know what\u2019s
      up.0312r"
    - 'w: Sir, I can testify. Yesterday, the president ordered me to leave and took
      care of the supplies himself. I can tell you which specific boxes had not been
      processed at that point.'
    - "p: Ah\u2026I see."
    - "p: It\u2019s really not that hard. Following instructions, I mean. But you
      couldn\u2019t even do such a simple thing."
    - 'y: So you insist on leaving your people to their doom?'
    - "p: Well, it\u2019s none of your business anymore. You\u2019re fired."
    - "y: What? You can\u2019t just-"
    - "p: Why not? I\u2019m the one in charge here. Goodbye. You should go pack your
      bags now."
    nextDialogue: {fileID: 0}
